    {
      "id": "RGChl",
      "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math>  and  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math>",
