  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Ruby is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> in which Red colour is obtained when <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math> is replacing <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math> ions in octahedral sites. Emerald is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub></math> in which green colour is obtained when <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math> is replacing <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math> in octahedral site.</p>",
